  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\nBALLINDRIMLEY, CASTLEREA, CO. ROSCOMMON\n\n3 BEDROOM DETACHED BUNGALOW WITH INTEGRATED GARAGE\n\nSHOWHOUSE CONDITION THROUGHOUT\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this beautifully maintained three-bedroom detached bungalow in the popular Ballindrimley area of Castlerea.\n\nPresented in showhouse condition throughout, this attractive residence offers bright, comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation finished to an excellent standard. Quality flooring, timber internal doors, fitted curtains and blinds, PVC windows and external doors, together with aluminium guttering, complement this exceptionally well-maintained home.\n\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hallway, sitting room with inset solid-fuel stove, modern fitted kitchen, three bedrooms and bathroom.\n\nThe integrated garage is presently used as a garage/utility area and provides valuable additional space, with potential for conversion to a fourth bedroom, home office or additional living accommodation, subject to any necessary permissions or requirements.\n\nExternally, the property is approached by a tarmac driveway with mature gardens to the front. To the rear is a large private site offering excellent outdoor space.\n\nBallindrimley is a convenient residential location on the outskirts of Castlerea. The property benefits from footpath access, public lighting and mains sewerage, while Castlerea town and its shops, schools, sporting facilities, medical services, train station and other everyday amenities are all within easy reach.\n\nThis property should appeal to purchasers seeking a detached home that is ready for immediate occupation in a convenient location close to Castlerea.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nSOLE SELLING AGENTS\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\nNigel Dineen MIPAV MMCEPI\n086 213 0723\n\nOffice\n094 936 2216\n\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\n\nEVERYTHING WE TOUCH TURNS TO SOLD.\n\nDISCLAIMER:\nThese particulars are issued for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. All measurements, areas, distances and descriptions are approximate. The agents have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, services or equipment and intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to their condition and accuracy.",
